      ":question/problem": "Consider the following inhomogeneous system of linear differential equations:\n\n$$\n{x}^{\u2032}(t)=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ -2 & -3\\end{aligned}]x(t)+[\\begin{aligned}-2t+1 \\\\ 8t\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe complementary solution to this system is given by\n\n$$\n{x}_{c}(t)={c}_{1}[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]{e}^{-2t}+{c}_{2}[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]{e}^{-t},\\,{c}_{1},{c}_{2}\\in R.\n$$\n\nThen, the general solution of the system is\n\n| $x(t)={x}_{c}(t)+\\,\\,$ |  | $1$ |  | $\\,\\,t+\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} |  | . |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} |  |  | $0$ |  |  |  |  |"
